        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮನಸ್ಸು (manassu) is Sanskrit manas, \"mind\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama, with Kannada's added -u (CDIAL 9822). The final -s is doubled before Kannada's -u."
            }
          ]
        },
